{"documentType":"story-maker-project","schemaVersion":9,"savedAt":"2026-11-20T03:27:58.000Z","appVersion":"knolstory-next-0.1","project":{"cover":{"author":"전래 이야기 · 놀퀴즈","subtitle":"용왕의 병을 고치려 자라가 토끼를 꾀어 바닷속으로 데려가요. 토끼는 무사히 돌아올 수 있을까요?","authorNote":"그림을 보고 인물의 마음과 다음 사건을 상상해 보세요.","layout":"classic","theme":"forest","font":"serif","titlePosition":"top","authorPosition":"bottom","align":"center","titleSize":36,"titleColor":"","backgroundId":"","characterId":"","characterPosition":"center"},"choiceMode":"simple","id":"757056f7-c38d-4bc7-8024-9f9d192536c9","title":"[내작품] 별주부전","description":"용왕의 병을 고치려 자라가 토끼를 꾀어 바닷속으로 데려가요. 토끼는 무사히 돌아올 수 있을까요?","planning":{"premise":"","structureMode":"free","material":"","theme":"","mainCharacter":"","mainGoal":"","centralProblem":"","stakes":"","endingChange":"","opening":"","middle":"","crisis":"","climax":"","ending":"","characterNotes":"","worldNotes":"","mood":"","openQuestions":"","freeNotes":""},"creativeMemos":[],"sheetUrl":"","sheetEditable":false,"speakerNames":[],"chapters":[{"chapterNumber":1,"id":"707d4771-7e16-4899-9376-4b6520e8091a","order":1,"title":"용궁의 근심","summary":"용왕이 깊은 병에 걸렸어요. 토끼의 간이 약이 된다는 말을 듣고, 별주부가 토끼를 찾아 육지로 가겠다고 나섰어요.","purpose":"","mood":"","keyEvents":"","nextChapterIdea":"","storyStageKeys":[],"chapterSpeakerNames":[],"characterAssetIds":[],"backgroundAssetIds":[],"backgroundId":"","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":"","picturebookSketch":{"backgroundId":"rabbit-turtle.scene.shortstory-classic-01","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":""}},{"chapterNumber":2,"id":"50352098-9d39-4234-89bd-070226729925","order":2,"title":"낯선 육지","summary":"바다에서 나온 별주부는 낯선 풀숲과 언덕을 살폈어요. 토끼의 모습을 떠올리며, 어디에서 토끼를 만날 수 있을지 생각했지요.","purpose":"","mood":"","keyEvents":"","nextChapterIdea":"","storyStageKeys":[],"chapterSpeakerNames":[],"characterAssetIds":[],"backgroundAssetIds":[],"backgroundId":"","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":"","picturebookSketch":{"backgroundId":"rabbit-turtle.scene.shortstory-classic-02","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":""}},{"chapterNumber":3,"id":"c55bb986-d680-44ba-96f7-9690d6daf400","order":3,"title":"달콤한 초대","summary":"토끼를 만난 별주부는 용궁의 멋진 잔치를 이야기했어요. 간을 구하러 왔다는 사실은 숨긴 채, 함께 용궁으로 가자고 권했지요.","purpose":"","mood":"","keyEvents":"","nextChapterIdea":"","storyStageKeys":[],"chapterSpeakerNames":[],"characterAssetIds":[],"backgroundAssetIds":[],"backgroundId":"","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":"","picturebookSketch":{"backgroundId":"rabbit-turtle.scene.shortstory-classic-03","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":""}},{"chapterNumber":4,"id":"2407310e-609b-474d-9b12-1636bd843fcb","order":4,"title":"바다를 건너","summary":"토끼는 별주부의 등에 올라 바다를 건넜어요. 신기한 용궁을 볼 생각에 설렜지만, 깊은 바다에서 혼자 돌아갈 방법은 없었어요. 토끼는 파도 소리에 귀를 쫑긋 세웠어요.","purpose":"","mood":"","keyEvents":"","nextChapterIdea":"","storyStageKeys":[],"chapterSpeakerNames":[],"characterAssetIds":[],"backgroundAssetIds":[],"backgroundId":"","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":"","picturebookSketch":{"backgroundId":"rabbit-turtle.scene.shortstory-classic-04","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":""}},{"chapterNumber":5,"id":"cad57d52-c302-4aa3-8766-1e53604d2b77","order":5,"title":"뜻밖의 위기","summary":"용궁에 도착한 토끼는 용왕의 병을 고치기 위해 자기 간이 필요하다는 말을 들었어요. 깜짝 놀랐지만, 살아 돌아갈 방법을 찾으려고 정신을 가다듬었지요.","purpose":"","mood":"","keyEvents":"","nextChapterIdea":"","storyStageKeys":[],"chapterSpeakerNames":[],"characterAssetIds":[],"backgroundAssetIds":[],"backgroundId":"","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":"","picturebookSketch":{"backgroundId":"rabbit-turtle.scene.shortstory-classic-05","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":""}},{"chapterNumber":6,"id":"39c0da72-5435-4635-ba84-d308ea46ca98","order":6,"title":"위기를 뒤집는 꾀","summary":"토끼는 간을 육지에 두고 왔다고 말했어요. 다시 데려다주면 가져오겠다는 말에 용왕은 별주부에게 토끼를 뭍으로 돌려보내라고 했지요.","purpose":"","mood":"","keyEvents":"","nextChapterIdea":"","storyStageKeys":[],"chapterSpeakerNames":[],"characterAssetIds":[],"backgroundAssetIds":[],"backgroundId":"","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":"","picturebookSketch":{"backgroundId":"rabbit-turtle.scene.shortstory-classic-06","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":""}},{"chapterNumber":7,"id":"ecd4ab1b-5a16-41be-a32e-6ff3ce92f10a","order":7,"title":"다시 밟은 땅","summary":"뭍에 닿자 토끼는 별주부의 등에서 폴짝 뛰어내렸어요. 간은 몸속에 있다며 달아나자, 별주부는 그제야 토끼의 꾀에 속았다는 것을 알았지요.","purpose":"","mood":"","keyEvents":"","nextChapterIdea":"","storyStageKeys":[],"chapterSpeakerNames":[],"characterAssetIds":[],"backgroundAssetIds":[],"backgroundId":"","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":"","picturebookSketch":{"backgroundId":"rabbit-turtle.scene.shortstory-classic-07","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":""}},{"chapterNumber":8,"id":"caa9f9c8-28d4-45dd-9aee-ee1511c1a381","order":8,"title":"숲으로 돌아간 토끼","summary":"토끼는 풀숲으로 달려가고 별주부는 물가에 남았어요. 토끼는 달콤한 말을 믿고 위험에 빠졌지만, 침착하게 생각한 덕분에 목숨을 구했지요.","purpose":"","mood":"","keyEvents":"","nextChapterIdea":"","storyStageKeys":[],"chapterSpeakerNames":[],"characterAssetIds":[],"backgroundAssetIds":[],"backgroundId":"","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":"","picturebookSketch":{"backgroundId":"rabbit-turtle.scene.shortstory-classic-08","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":""}}],"lines":[{"id":"c323dd50-caaa-4449-a8a0-fda92dada9b1","chapterId":"707d4771-7e16-4899-9376-4b6520e8091a","order":1,"type":"narration","speaker":"narration","speakerName":"","text":"","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":"","backgroundId":"","backgroundMode":"none","purposeNote":"","emotionNote":"","directionNote":"","stageComposition":{"leftActors":[],"rightActors":[]}},{"id":"1778cee3-da6f-4884-8c46-6575f263032f","chapterId":"c55bb986-d680-44ba-96f7-9690d6daf400","order":1,"type":"narration","speaker":"narration","speakerName":"","text":"","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId":"","backgroundId":"","backgroundMode":"none","purposeNote":"","emotionNote":"","directionNote":"","stageComposition":{"leftActors":[],"rightActors":[]}},{"id":"264b38f6-19ee-4a29-a52b-fdfe9185a0cd","chapterId":"2407310e-609b-474d-9b12-1636bd843fcb","order":1,"type":"narration","speaker":"narration","speakerName":"토끼","text":"바다 한가운데서 토끼가 물었어요. “용궁은 아직 멀었나요?”","leftAssetId":"","rightAssetId